              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">A Norman knight has a hand weapon, light armour, thrusting spear and shield. Shock Cavalry. First Charge. May have heavy armour (+1) and lance (+3). May be mounted on a warhorse (+7).</characteristic>
