              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Skirmishers have a hand weapon, javelins and buckler. Skirmishers. May exchange javelins and buckler for sling (free) or composite bow (+1). Note: Points for dismounted knights are taken from the Cavalry points allocation.</characteristic>
